# Rextensions

Monorepo: Chrome MV3 popup extension + Astro marketing site.

## Packages

- `apps/extension` — manage installed extensions, export/import lists, Firebase cloud backup/restore
- `apps/web` — SEO marketing site (Astro SSG → Firebase Hosting)

## Stack (extension)

- Vue 3 + TypeScript + Pinia + Vue Router (hash history for extension pages)
- Vite 7 build → load **`apps/extension/dist/`** in Chrome
- Tailwind 4 + shadcn-vue (Reka UI) under `apps/extension/src/components/ui/`
- Firebase Auth + Firestore; **Google-only** sign-in via Chrome Identity

## Commands (repo root)

- `npm install` — all workspaces
- `npm run build:extension` / `npm run build:web` / `npm run build`
- `npm run dev:extension` — vite build --watch
- `npm run dev:web` — Astro dev server
- `npm run deploy:web` — build web + Firebase Hosting

## Key paths

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `apps/extension/public/manifest.json` | MV3 manifest; OAuth placeholder `__INJECT_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID__` |
| `apps/extension/popup.html` / `src/popup.ts` | Popup entry |
| `apps/extension/src/background.ts` | Service worker |
| `apps/web/src/pages/` | Marketing routes |
| `firebase.json` | Hosting → `apps/web/dist` |
| `firestore.rules` | Cloud backup rules (repo root) |

## Env

- Extension: `apps/extension/.env` ← `.env.example` (`VITE_CHROME_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID`)
- Web: `apps/web/.env` ← `.env.example` (`PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, optional `PUBLIC_CWS_URL`, `PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL`)
